Pilots! UMC announces the introduction of additional Happy Hours on Thursdays!

Now, for each victory in PvP mode from 16:00 MSK on Monday until 04: 00 MSK on Tuesday and from 16:00 MSK on Thursday until 04:00 MSK on Friday, players will get Galactic Standards!

Galactic Standards are used as a universal and widely recognized currency for the purchase of unique goods and services in the Star Conflict universe. With “Galactic Standards” your progress in the game will become easier and more comfortable.

Galactic standards can be spent on:
[list]
[*] Participation in trading transactions with players;
[*] Premium ships. Such ships bring their pilots more credits and experience;
[*] Credits;
[*] Experience. The accumulated experience of elite ships can be translated into free experience;
[*] An extra combat slot for a ship;
[*] Additional crew slots;
[*] Ship appearance customization. New paint and stickers;
[*] Change pilot's call sign, portrait and taunt phrases.
[/list]

Boost your fleet! Let's win together!

Yours truly,
Star Conflict Team

